{"seq":1,"slug":"dynamic-table-stream-table-duality","title":"动态表与流表二元性：持续查询的语义基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/streaming-sql-materialized-view-engine-flink/continuous-query-streaming-sql/dynamic-table-stream-table-duality","wordCount":2645,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"动态表与流表二元性-持续查询的语义基础\">动态表与流表二元性：持续查询的语义基础</h1><p>一个跨境电商团队把 MySQL 订单库接进 Flink SQL，写下 <code>SELECT country, SUM(amount) FROM orders GROUP BY country</code>，然后困惑于一个问题：既然流上永远不会「加载完」，这个 <code>SUM</code> 到底在什么时候算完？答案是它从不「算完」——它在每一行订单到达时被重新求值一次，结果表在时间轴上不断被改写。理解这套语义的前提，是接受一个反直觉的定义：<strong>在流式 SQL 里，表不是一个静态快照，而是一条随时间变化的记录流</strong>。本文交代这套语义的完整链条：动态表、持续查询、流表二元性与 changelog 编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-静态表与动态表\">核心概念：静态表与动态表</h2><p>关系代数里，表是有限的元组集合，查询是一次性映射，求值有起点有终点。Flink 的表概念文档从头改写了这两点：<strong>动态表（dynamic table）</strong> 是一个随时间变化的关系，流式 SQL 中的每一张表都是动态表；<strong>持续查询（continuous query）</strong> 是一个永不终止的查询，它把输入动态表映射为输出动态表，并在输入发生变化时更新输出（Apache Flink 文档 <em>Dynamic Tables</em>，nightlies.apache.org/flink/flink-docs-release-1.20/docs/dev/table/concepts/dynamic_tables/）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>批处理中的静态表</th>\n<th>流处理中的动态表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间性</td>\n<td>求值瞬间的有限集合</td>\n<td>随输入持续追加/改写的多版本关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询生命周期</td>\n<td>一次求值后终止</td>\n<td>长期驻留，输入变化即触发增量更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出含义</td>\n<td>结果快照</td>\n<td>结果的变更日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代价来源</td>\n<td>数据规模（扫描多少行）</td>\n<td>状态规模与变更频率（维护多少中间态）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张对照表解释了为什么流 SQL 的性能模型和批完全不同：批查询贵在「扫一遍」，持续查询贵在「记住中间状态并持续改写」。一个 <code>GROUP BY country</code> 在批里只需一次哈希聚合，在流里却要为每个国家维护一个累加器，且累加器要能在故障后恢复——这是本 hub 后续章节要展开的状态与容错问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[数据流 append-only&lt;br/&gt;orders CDC INSERT] --&gt;|stream to table| DT[动态表 orders&lt;br/&gt;随时间变化的多版本关系]&#10;  DT --&gt;|continuous query| Q[持续查询&lt;br/&gt;GROUP BY country]&#10;  Q --&gt; DTR[动态结果表&lt;br/&gt;每国家一行, 被反复改写]&#10;  DTR --&gt;|table to stream| CS[结果变更流&lt;br/&gt;+I 插入 / -U 撤回 / +U 重插]&#10;  CS --&gt; SINK[upsert-kafka / 物化视图]&#10;  S2[流中到来的每一行] --&gt;|触发一次增量求值| Q\">graph TD\n  S[数据流 append-only&lt;br/&gt;orders CDC INSERT] --&gt;|stream to table| DT[动态表 orders&lt;br/&gt;随时间变化的多版本关系]\n  DT --&gt;|continuous query| Q[持续查询&lt;br/&gt;GROUP BY country]\n  Q --&gt; DTR[动态结果表&lt;br/&gt;每国家一行, 被反复改写]\n  DTR --&gt;|table to stream| CS[结果变更流&lt;br/&gt;+I 插入 / -U 撤回 / +U 重插]\n  CS --&gt; SINK[upsert-kafka / 物化视图]\n  S2[流中到来的每一行] --&gt;|触发一次增量求值| Q</pre><h2 id=\"持续查询-把-sql-求值改成长期算子\">持续查询：把 SQL 求值改成长期算子</h2><p>Flink 的早期文档用一节 <em>Continuous Queries on Dynamic Tables</em> 把机制讲得很直白：持续查询对动态表求值，产出另一张动态表；每当输入表有新行到达，查询就产生一个新的结果版本。这条叙述的关键是「<strong>结果版本</strong>」——不是修改某一行，而是产生整张结果表的一个新历史版本，而两个版本之间的差异才被下发。</p>\n<p>因此三条结论直接成立：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>查询是增量的。</strong> 引擎不重算全表，而是维护一份算子状态（聚合累加器、join 缓冲、去重索引），输入的一行只驱动一次局部更新。</li>\n<li><strong>输出必须携带「撤销」信息。</strong> 若 <code>US</code> 的 <code>SUM(amount)</code> 从 1000 变成 1080，下游必须知道「旧的 1000 不再成立」。只发新值会导致下游重复累加——这是所有流式聚合正确性的分水岭。</li>\n<li><strong>完整性由 watermark 划界。</strong> 在事件时间语义下，只有当 watermark 越过某个窗口/时间点，引擎才敢断言「该时间点之前的结果不会再变」，从而允许状态被清理。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 2 点意味着持续查询的输出不是普通数据流，而是一条 <strong>changelog（变更日志）</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流表二元性-同一条数据流的两种读法\">流表二元性：同一条数据流的两种读法</h2><p>流与表在这个模型里是一枚硬币的两面：<strong>流可以看作一张表的变更日志，表可以看作一条流的物化结果</strong>。Flink 文档把两个方向的转换都定义为无损可逆的编码问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>流 → 表。</strong> 到来的每一行是一条 <code>INSERT</code>；对一张 append-only 的流做此转换，得到的是一张只增不改的表。</li>\n<li><strong>表 → 流。</strong> 把动态结果表的变更事件编码成流，Flink 提供三种编码（Flink 文档 <em>Dynamic Tables</em>）：</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流类型</th>\n<th>行编码</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>前置条件</th>\n<th>典型 sink</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Append-only 流</td>\n<td>仅 INSERT</td>\n<td>只追加，不撤销</td>\n<td>结果表只增不改（非聚合查询）</td>\n<td>文件系统、append-only Kafka</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retract 流</td>\n<td><code>(Boolean, Row)</code>，true=加、false=撤</td>\n<td>显式携带撤销，通用</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>任何能表达删除的下游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Upsert 流</td>\n<td><code>+I/-D/+U</code> 且以主键定位</td>\n<td>同键的新值覆盖旧值，<code>-U/+U</code> 被折叠为一条 <code>+U</code></td>\n<td>结果表必须有唯一键</td>\n<td>upsert-kafka、JDBC 表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种编码的取舍是<strong>信息量 vs 体积</strong>。Retract 流信息最全但最重：一次更新要发两条记录；Upsert 流把 <code>-U/+U</code> 压成一条，代价是要求主键存在，且下游必须按主键分区消费，否则撤单会落到错误的分片。这正是「表必须有主键」在流 SQL DDL 里不是装饰性的原因——它是 upsert 编码能否成立的结构前提。</p>\n<p><code>RowKind</code> 是这套编码在 Flink 中的具体载体，四个取值为 <code>+I</code>（insert）、<code>-U</code>（update_before）、<code>+U</code>（update_after）、<code>-D</code>（delete）。它与 Debezium 的 CDC 信封可直接对应：<code>op=c</code> → <code>+I</code>，<code>op=u</code> → <code>-U</code>+<code>+U</code>（<code>before</code> 与 <code>after</code> 两个镜像），<code>op=d</code> → <code>-D</code>（debezium.io <em>Connector for MySQL</em>）。这张映射表是把业务库变更接进流 SQL 的语义接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时态语义-谁决定-现在\">时态语义：谁决定「现在」</h2><p>流表二元性本身不指定时间，动态表必须显式声明时间属性，否则聚合无从划界。Flink SQL 有两种（Flink 文档 <em>Time Attributes</em>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>处理时间（processing time）</strong>：由执行引擎的本地时钟给出，用 <code>PROCTIME()</code> 计算列声明。它无需数据带时间戳，延迟最低，但结果<strong>不可重放</strong>——同一份数据重跑两次会得到不同结果，因为时钟没走同一条路。</li>\n<li><strong>事件时间（event time）</strong>：由数据自带的时间戳给出，配合 <code>WATERMARK FOR ts AS ts - INTERVAL &#39;5&#39; SECOND</code> 声明水印。水印是一条断言：「我不会再看到时间戳早于它的数据了」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在跨境电商场景里这个区分是硬需求。订单的 <code>created_at</code> 来自业务库服务器时钟，经 CDC 进入 Kafka，可能因分区分发与重试乱序到达；若用处理时间做「按小时 GMV」，一次积压回放就会把昨天的单算进今天。事件时间 + 水印把正确性锚在数据自身的时点上，代价是引入延迟：设水印滞后为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>、下游结算窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，则结果的最早确定时刻为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{final}} = \\max_{r \\in R}(t_r) + w + T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{r}(t_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是「最后一条属于该窗口的记录到达时刻」。要降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{final}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只能牺牲确定性（缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>）或缩小窗口，不能两者兼得——这就是「实时看板」与「准确看板」在流 SQL 里的量化对立面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"更新流的完整性-为什么不能只发新值\">更新流的完整性：为什么不能只发新值</h2><p>设一段时间内某分组键上的变更次数为：新增分组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、更新既有分组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、删除分组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则三种编码下输出的记录数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>retract</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>upsert</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|C_{\\text{retract}}| = n_{+} + 2 n_{\\Delta} + n_{-}, \\qquad\n|C_{\\text{upsert}}| = n_{+} + n_{\\Delta} + n_{-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retract</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">upsert</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Retract 编码恰好多出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条——每此更新都多一条撤销。这不是浪费：<strong>它让下游不需要知道主键就能正确地做「减法」</strong>。反过来，Upsert 编码把正确性的负担转移给了主键与分区。工程上的判定规则可以写死成一句：<strong>结果表有主键且下游能按键分区，用 upsert；否则用 retract。</strong></p>\n<p>还有一个常被忽略的约束：<strong>并非所有 sink 都能接收更新流</strong>。一个 append-only 的文件 sink 或下游是 append-only 的分析表时，把带 <code>-U</code> 的流写进去会得到一张「每版结果都堆在里面」的表，读者看到的不是当前值而是全部历史。所以「往哪里存」这件事反过来约束了上游能用什么编码——这正是本 hub 后续章节讨论物化视图维护与流批一体的起点：物化视图的作用，就是把「必须由消费者承担的重算与去重」换成「由引擎在写入侧维护一份正确的结果」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在跨境电商语境下的落地形态\">在跨境电商语境下的落地形态</h2><p>把上面的语义链条放到一条真实链路里，形状是这样的：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>接入。</strong> MySQL 订单库开 binlog，Debezium 采集为 CDC 流（<code>op=c/u/d</code>），送入 Kafka 的 <code>orders</code> topic。此时它是一条 changelog 流，不是表。</li>\n<li><strong>建表。</strong> Flink SQL 用 <code>CREATE TABLE orders (...) WITH (&#39;connector&#39;=&#39;kafka&#39;, &#39;format&#39;=&#39;debezium-json&#39;)</code> 声明源表，<code>order_id</code> 为主键，<code>created_at</code> 为事件时间并声明水印。此刻 SDK 层已把它识别为「有主键的 upsert 源」。</li>\n<li><strong>持续查询。</strong> <code>SELECT country, SUM(amount) ... GROUP BY country</code> 产出一张只含「当前值」的动态结果表；每一步更新的撤销量由上面的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\Delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定。</li>\n<li><strong>落地。</strong> 结果写入 upsert-kafka 或写入物化视图表（Materialized Table），供看板或下游语义层消费；若下游只支持追加，则必须先经物化视图把重算收敛在写入侧。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>同一套语义在其他引擎里有不同叫法：Kafka Streams 把「表」叫 <code>KTable</code>、「流」叫 <code>KStream</code>，并以 <code>null</code> 值（tombstone）表达删除（kafka.apache.org <em>KTable</em>）；Materialize 与 RisingWave 把结果表直接建成 <code>CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW</code>，由数据流引擎增量维护（materialize.com、risingwerse.com）。<strong>它们的共同点正是本文的主线：把「表」定义为 chlog 的可累积视图，把「查询」定义为对变更的持续翻译。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流式 SQL 中的表是<strong>动态表</strong>——随时间被改写的多版本关系；查询是<strong>持续查询</strong>，输入变化即触发增量求值。</li>\n<li>流表二元性是编码问题：流 → 表靠「每行即 INSERT」，表 → 流有 append-only / retract / upsert 三种编码，取舍在信息量与体积之间。</li>\n<li>Retract 编码携带显式撤销（<code>-U</code>/<code>+U</code>），是通用形态；Upsert 编码以主键把更新压成一条，且要求下游按键分区。</li>\n<li><code>RowKind</code> 的 <code>+I/-U/+U/-D</code> 与 Debezium 的 <code>op=c/u/d</code> 直接对应，这是业务库变更接入流 SQL 的语义接口。</li>\n<li>时间语义必须在表上声明：处理时间低延迟但不可重放；事件时间 + 水印锚定正确性，代价是最早确定时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{final}} = \\max_r(t_r) + w + T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>Sink 的能力反向约束上游编码；物化视图/物化表的作用，是把重算与去重从消费者侧搬到写入侧。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>资料来源：Apache Flink 官方文档 <em>Dynamic Tables</em>、<em>Time Attributes</em>、<em>Continuous Queries on Dynamic Tables</em>（nightlies.apache.org/flink/flink-docs-release-1.20/docs/dev/table/concepts/）；Flink 2.0（2025-03 发布）引入的 Materialized Tables（FLIP-435）；Debezium <em>Connector for MySQL</em> 变更事件信封（debezium.io）；Kafka Streams <em>KTable</em> 与 tombstone 删除语义（kafka.apache.org）；Materialize 增量维护视图（materialize.com）；RisingWave 流式物化视图（risingwerse.com）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动态表与流表二元性：持续查询的语义基础","id":"动态表与流表二元性-持续查询的语义基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：静态表与动态表","id":"核心概念-静态表与动态表"},{"level":2,"text":"持续查询：把 SQL 求值改成长期算子","id":"持续查询-把-sql-求值改成长期算子"},{"level":2,"text":"流表二元性：同一条数据流的两种读法","id":"流表二元性-同一条数据流的两种读法"},{"level":2,"text":"时态语义：谁决定「现在」","id":"时态语义-谁决定-现在"},{"level":2,"text":"更新流的完整性：为什么不能只发新值","id":"更新流的完整性-为什么不能只发新值"},{"level":2,"text":"在跨境电商语境下的落地形态","id":"在跨境电商语境下的落地形态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"事件时间、Watermark 与 SQL 窗口/Join 语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/streaming-sql-materialized-view-engine-flink/continuous-query-streaming-sql/event-time-watermark-window-join-sql"}}